# Terraform with LF on every checkout. A heredoc keeps the file's line endings
# in the value it builds, so a CRLF checkout on Windows applies different
# strings from the LF deploy runner, and every deploy then plans a change.
# That happened to the deploy identity's role condition, a grant the deploy
# may not change, so every deploy failed with a 403.
*.tf     text eol=lf
*.tfvars text eol=lf
*.hcl    text eol=lf
